{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_99_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_99","textTraditional":"一、三年，春王正月，叔孫得臣會晉人、宋人、陳人、衞人、鄭人伐沈，沈潰。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_99_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_99","textTraditional":"二、夏五月，王子虎卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_99_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_99","textTraditional":"王子虎者何？天子之大夫也。外大夫不卒，此何以卒？新使乎我也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_99_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_99","textTraditional":"三、秦人伐晉。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_99_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_99","textTraditional":"四、秋，楚人圍江。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_99_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_99","textTraditional":"五、雨螽于宋。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_99_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_99","textTraditional":"雨螽者何？死而墜也。何以書？記異也。外異不書，此何以書？為王者之後記異也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_99_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_99","textTraditional":"六、冬，公如晉。十有二月己巳，公及晉侯盟。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_99_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_99","textTraditional":"七、晉陽處父帥師伐楚以救江。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_99_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_99","textTraditional":"此伐楚也，其言救江何？為諼也。其為諼奈何？伐楚為救江也。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}